   get DataView.prototype.byteLength
 
-  5. If IsViewOutOfBounds(viewRecord) is true, return +0𝔽.
+  5. If IsViewOutOfBounds(viewRecord) is true, throw a TypeError exception.
 
   IsViewOutOfBounds ( viewRecord )
 
